  "content": "Neither read has anything current. No attendance is on record for the team, and none of the eight players has an active goal that a coach set or a player shared. A goal a player keeps private wouldn't appear here, so that may be part of the gap.\n\nFive older goals exist, all with end dates in July 2026. They belong to two players, and the other six have no goal on record.\n\n**Cole Bennett**\n- **Wedge distance control:** Achieved. Average proximity went from 28 ft to 15.29 ft against an 18 ft target.\n- **Short putting, 3 to 5 ft:** Missed. The make rate went from 82% to 46.5% against a 92% target.\n\n**Owen Carter**\n- **Approach dispersion:** Missed, but close. Proximity went from 24 ft to 15.95 ft against a 15 ft target.\n- **5 to 10 ft make rate:** Missed. The rate went from 58% to 34.5% against a 75% target.\n- **Short-side scrambling from rough:** Missed. The baseline was 35% and the target 55%. No current value was recorded, so I can't say how far it moved.\n\nBoth players improved their approach numbers, but both ended lower on mid-range and short putting than where they started. If you want to follow up on that, I can look at their current putting by distance. Setting fresh goals for the other six players is also an option.",
